  "content": "<p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">從山脈到沙漠！<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1169375/description_7572fd14-c467-47d7-8eb3-957b16ee1f17.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"847\" height=\"713\"></span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 體驗探索山脈、河流、沙漠和森林的獨特旅程。如同上次我製作的有作弊版和無作弊版。你將在地圖中心重生，往西南方前進會發現一條河流和巨大的湖泊，再往前會遇到山脈，越過山脈則會看到紅木森林。往東北方探索會發現沙漠、山脈和河流。還有更多精彩內容！</span><span style=\"color:#fff\">這些專案得以實現，多虧了像您這樣的慷慨捐助。</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>&nbsp;祝您玩得開心，願上帝保佑您 :)</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1169375/description_6f35ce5d-1dec-4a42-af48-7e342178a8ab.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"370\" height=\"208\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>試試我的其他地圖！</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/forest-and-fields-adventure-map\" rel=\"nofollow\">森林與田野</a><br></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/the-mysterious-island\" rel=\"nofollow\">神秘島嶼</a></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/seven-survival-islands\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">七座生存島嶼</a></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>J.M.J</strong></span></p>",
